Cursor artwork
--------------
Every pixel in the .cur and .ani files under out_native/ is Apple Inc.'s own
cursor artwork, obtained from the MacOS27-Windows-Cursors dump (a .cape of
the macOS 27 "Golden Gate" cursor resources).

This repository does not redraw, retrace, recolour or otherwise alter that
artwork. The only changes applied are to the packaging:

  * pages padded to a square canvas, artwork centred (aspect ratio preserved)
  * a full size ladder added (24/32/48/64/96/128/192/256)
  * hotspots recomputed per page from each page's own source bitmap
  * the AND mask corrected to be exactly the complement of the alpha channel

The animation frame content, frame count and playback rate of Wait.ani and
AppStarting.ani are Apple's; only the pixel packaging was changed.

